fixture dash_cancel_keeps_earlier_attack
doc BUILD.md s15 Combat "Dash cancels an attack on frame 4 and the cancel never eats the next attack input"; docs/adr/0010, Dash cancels (movement review 4, L1). Side 1 on frame 0, the next attack pressed on its frame 2 (waiting for the chain on frame 6), the dash on its frame 6: the dash cancels the strike and takes the press over, and side 2 comes out on dash frame 6, however old the press is by then. (It used to be 9 frames old at dash frame 6, past the attack buffer, and never came out.)
room test/flat
spawn 200 544
frames 30
input
  0 !attack
  1 !attack
  2..4
  5 dash
  6..29
end
expect
  at 0 action=side1
  at 5 event.dash=1 state=dash action=none
  mark slash 6..29 event.attack=1
  at slash action=side2
end
